1
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,800
What's going on? What are
all these people doing here?

2
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:38,800
I came to see you for the last time
before I return to the Celestial Court

3
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,800
Ruyi, come with me

4
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:48,800
-Shou!
-Ruyi, come with me

5
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:50,800
No, we're no match for them

6
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,800
How did things
turn out like this?

7
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:58,800
-I have one last request
-Speak

8
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,800
Please help me lift
the Obedience Spell

9
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:19,800
Shou...

10
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:22,800
Shou... Shou...

11
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:30,800
-The spell has been lifted
-Really?

12
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:33,800
I know you were sincere

13
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:36,800
I know you were sincere

14
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:39,800
Can you not leave?

15
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:43,800
Can you not leave?

16
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,800
Ma-gu, come with me

17
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:52,800
Ruyi, don't go

18
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:55,800
The Jade Emperor decreed you should
suffer trials and tribulations

19
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:59,800
You've been through the plague
and the calamities of war

20
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,800
Make sure you complete
your mission

21
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:05,800
-I will
-Come with me!

22
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:09,800
Shou! Shou!

23
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:13,800
Ruyi, don't go

24
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,800
Come!

25
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:20,800
Ruyi! Ruyi! Don't go

26
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:24,800
Your last chance of becoming
an immortal is on your 30th birthday

27
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:27,800
After which, you will never
be reinstated

28
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:29,800
The Three Stars will be gone
forever

29
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,800
Come on!

30
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:45,200
Got you. I give you my word
I will accomplish my mission

31
00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:49,300
Bad news, Your Highness!
Bad news, Your Highness!

32
00:04:49,700 --> 00:04:53,700
They've really rebelled
and occupied Ping-an Town...

33
00:04:53,700 --> 00:04:56,700
and are now charging openly
towards us

34
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:58,300
What shall we do?

35
00:04:58,700 --> 00:05:01,300
We're in no position
to clash head-on with them

36
00:05:02,700 --> 00:05:08,300
Don't worry. Let's inform the king
and get him to despatch troops

37
00:05:08,700 --> 00:05:11,300
They've occupied Ping-an Town?
We'll surround it

38
00:05:26,700 --> 00:05:29,300
I wonder how Ping-an Town
is doing

39
00:05:30,700 --> 00:05:35,300
To think that it's fallen into
Ouyang Xiaotian's hands

40
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:39,300
Your Highness, don't worry

41
00:05:40,700 --> 00:05:44,300
Ouyang Xiaotian is rebelling against
the court. We have to get rid of him

42
00:05:45,700 --> 00:05:51,300
He and his subordinates have done
so many wicked things

43
00:05:51,700 --> 00:05:54,300
I doubt the people will support him

44
00:05:56,700 --> 00:06:00,300
I hope he'll treat the people well
and not take innocent lives

45
00:06:11,700 --> 00:06:16,700
Shou! Ouyang Xiaotian and his troops
are charging into town. Let's go

46
00:06:16,700 --> 00:06:18,300
Ruyi is gone

47
00:06:18,700 --> 00:06:21,700
She's been captured by the Erlang
Deity who took her back to Heaven

48
00:06:22,300 --> 00:06:26,300
What are you talking about?
Let's flee before it's too late

49
00:06:28,700 --> 00:06:31,300
Let's flee or it'll be too late

50
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:34,300
They have many soldiers

51
00:06:49,700 --> 00:06:56,300
Open the city gates!
Open the city gates!

52
00:06:56,700 --> 00:07:02,300
Open the city gates!
Open the city gates!

53
00:07:04,700 --> 00:07:07,300
We're surrounded by hundreds
of thousands of troops

54
00:07:07,300 --> 00:07:08,300
More than that

55
00:07:11,700 --> 00:07:14,300
What shall we do?

56
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:17,300
Don't panic.
Don't panic

57
00:07:17,700 --> 00:07:19,300
Let's get the Marquis to come back

58
00:07:19,700 --> 00:07:23,300
No. He's handling
an important matter

59
00:07:23,700 --> 00:07:27,300
He's bent on levelling The Three Star
Temple. We mustn't disturb him

60
00:07:27,700 --> 00:07:29,300
But they're bearing down on us

61
00:07:29,700 --> 00:07:34,300
There's only one course open to us.
While they're still new here,

62
00:07:34,700 --> 00:07:37,300
let's charge our way
out of the encirclement

63
00:07:37,700 --> 00:07:39,300
-Can we do that?
-I suppose so

64
00:07:39,700 --> 00:07:42,300
-It'll be tough but not impossible
-I hope we can do it

65
00:07:42,700 --> 00:07:44,300
That's a waste of breath!

66
00:07:49,700 --> 00:07:54,300
Hesitate no more. Give the order!
We'll wipe them out!

67
00:07:59,700 --> 00:08:02,300
I don't want to press too hard
on them

68
00:08:02,700 --> 00:08:07,300
This is Lord Wei's hometown.
He feels attached to it

69
00:08:07,700 --> 00:08:09,300
We mustn't act rashly

70
00:08:09,700 --> 00:08:15,300
If anything goes wrong,
we'll be condemned through the ages

71
00:08:15,700 --> 00:08:20,300
It's best if we don't have to resort
to the use of force or cause any damage

72
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:25,300
If neither side suffers any casualties,
that'll be the greatest victory

73
00:08:26,700 --> 00:08:32,300
That's difficult, unless you can
persuade them to surrender

74
00:08:40,700 --> 00:08:45,300
We have to resort to arms.
Take our men and encircle the temple

75
00:08:45,700 --> 00:08:49,300
Spare no one in it.
Level the place!

76
00:09:06,700 --> 00:09:09,300
Let me go in and negotiate
with them personally

77
00:09:10,700 --> 00:09:15,300
You're going in alone?
Ouyang Xiaotian hates you like poison

78
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:17,300
Aren't you walking right
into the trap?

79
00:09:17,700 --> 00:09:22,300
Lord Wei, I admire your guts.
But that's too dangerous

80
00:09:22,700 --> 00:09:24,300
Do think thrice

81
00:09:25,700 --> 00:09:33,300
Don't worry. I know Shi Yaoqian
only too well

82
00:09:34,700 --> 00:09:41,300
Shi Yaoqian, open the city gates
and let me in alone

83
00:09:42,700 --> 00:09:45,300
-He's going to come in alone?
-That's right

84
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:48,300
What has he got up his sleeve?

85
00:09:50,700 --> 00:09:53,300
Wei Delu,
do you take me for a fool?

86
00:09:53,700 --> 00:09:57,300
What if you charge in when
I open the city gates and kill us?

87
00:09:57,700 --> 00:10:02,300
Shi Yaoqian, look down.
There's a chest of gold

88
00:10:03,700 --> 00:10:06,300
You have two options

89
00:10:06,700 --> 00:10:10,300
Open the city gates now and
this chest of gold will be yours

90
00:10:11,700 --> 00:10:15,300
If you still don't open the gates
in two hours' time,

91
00:10:15,700 --> 00:10:21,300
I'll charge in with my 300,000 troops.
You'll lose both your lives and gold

92
00:10:23,700 --> 00:10:27,300
-100,000 taels of gold
-Let him in and our heads will roll!

93
00:10:27,700 --> 00:10:31,300
If they charge in,
our heads will roll too

94
00:10:31,700 --> 00:10:34,300
The two of you,
go and open the city gates

95
00:10:34,700 --> 00:10:37,300
Don't forget to bring the gold in

96
00:10:38,700 --> 00:10:41,300
-Let's split the gold equally
-3:7

97
00:10:41,700 --> 00:10:44,300
-4:6
-3:7

98
00:10:44,700 --> 00:10:48,300
-What shall we do?
-Break our way out of the encirclement

99
00:10:50,700 --> 00:10:55,300
You reckless fools! There's no way
you can escape today!

100
00:11:01,700 --> 00:11:03,700
Wei Delu, be careful

101
00:11:04,700 --> 00:11:10,300
Lord Wei, if you don't return in six
hours, I'll charge in with my troops

102
00:11:10,700 --> 00:11:13,300
Don't worry, I'll be back

103
00:11:53,700 --> 00:11:56,300
Enough talk!
You're about to die!

104
00:12:00,700 --> 00:12:04,300
Today next year will be
your death anniversary

105
00:12:04,700 --> 00:12:06,300
Marquis!...

106
00:12:10,700 --> 00:12:14,300
He's courting his own doom.
Fine, I'll let them die together

107
00:12:14,700 --> 00:12:16,300
Bring him in

108
00:12:19,700 --> 00:12:21,300
Lu!

109
00:12:33,700 --> 00:12:36,300
-We're fine
-That's great

110
00:12:40,700 --> 00:12:43,300
You three sure are close

111
00:12:43,700 --> 00:12:46,300
I'll let you die together

112
00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:50,300
Ouyang Xiaotian,
I'm sure you're aware...

113
00:12:50,700 --> 00:12:56,300
that there are 300,000 troops
stationed outside the city walls

114
00:12:56,700 --> 00:12:58,300
You mustn't act rashly

115
00:13:01,700 --> 00:13:06,300
I'm afraid you'll be dead before
the 300,000 troops can come in

116
00:13:06,700 --> 00:13:08,300
You'll be the one dead

117
00:13:09,700 --> 00:13:13,300
If we don't leave this place
in two hours' time,

118
00:13:13,700 --> 00:13:17,300
the 300,000 troops will charge in,
sparing no one

119
00:13:18,700 --> 00:13:22,300
Ouyang Xiaotian, you are a hero

120
00:13:22,700 --> 00:13:26,300
I believe you don't want
the common people to come to harm

121
00:13:26,700 --> 00:13:32,300
When two armies are pitted against each
other, there'll be a bloodbath...

122
00:13:32,700 --> 00:13:34,300
and heavy casualties

123
00:13:34,700 --> 00:13:38,300
It's time we settled our private feud

124
00:13:38,700 --> 00:13:44,300
Let's make a gentleman's agreement.
What do you say?

125
00:13:46,700 --> 00:13:52,300
Well, Ouyang Xiaotian, are you too
scared to take the three of us on?

126
00:13:52,700 --> 00:13:56,300
You're asking for it

127
00:13:57,700 --> 00:14:01,300
Let's have a showdown
in three days' time

128
00:14:02,700 --> 00:14:04,300
Let's go

129
00:14:10,700 --> 00:14:15,300
Lu, Ouyang Xiaotian is so highly
skilled. Can we defeat him?

130
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:21,300
It's better to sacrifice the three of
us than the people of the entire city

131
00:14:21,700 --> 00:14:24,300
I'd throw in my lot with you, sir,
at the risk of my life

132
00:14:24,700 --> 00:14:27,300
Ruyi will watch over us

133
00:14:40,700 --> 00:14:42,300
Come here!

134
00:14:45,700 --> 00:14:47,300
Quick!

135
00:14:55,700 --> 00:15:00,300
Jade Emperor, I've brought Ma-gu.
She awaits punishment

136
00:15:02,700 --> 00:15:04,300
On your knees!

137
00:15:08,700 --> 00:15:13,300
Erlang Deity, you went down
to the mortal world personally...

138
00:15:13,700 --> 00:15:17,300
to capture Ma-gu-
I will reward you

139
00:15:17,700 --> 00:15:22,300
I heard Ma-gu was very crafty. You
spent a lot of effort capturing her

140
00:15:22,700 --> 00:15:24,300
Is that true?

141
00:15:24,700 --> 00:15:27,300
Yes, Jade Emperor. Ma-gu put on
a divine thread robe

142
00:15:27,700 --> 00:15:31,300
My third eye nearly got fooled
by it

143
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:36,300
I had no choice but to spread
a dragnet to trap her

144
00:15:37,700 --> 00:15:43,300
Ma-gu, how did you come to
possess a divine thread robe?

145
00:15:47,700 --> 00:15:49,300
There's nothing
strange about that

146
00:15:49,700 --> 00:15:55,300
As deities, all of us possess
a treasure or two

147
00:15:55,700 --> 00:15:58,300
Let her tell me herself

148
00:16:00,700 --> 00:16:06,300
Jade Emperor, what Ma-gu wore
was no ordinary divine thread robe

149
00:16:06,700 --> 00:16:10,300
Oh?
This is indeed a mystery

150
00:16:10,700 --> 00:16:14,300
Knowing I'd meet with danger
in the mortal world,

151
00:16:14,700 --> 00:16:21,300
I made Zhang Guolao drunk and stole
his divine thread robe before I left

152
00:16:23,700 --> 00:16:27,300
-Jade Emperor
-Stop interceding for her

153
00:16:29,700 --> 00:16:33,300
Ma-gu, how dare you tarnish
the reputation of the celestial court...

154
00:16:33,700 --> 00:16:35,300
by becoming a thief

155
00:16:35,700 --> 00:16:39,300
No!...

156
00:16:41,700 --> 00:16:46,300
Jade Emperor, Ma-gu did all this
to help her friends, the Three Stars

157
00:16:46,700 --> 00:16:52,300
She's a true and loyal friend.
Nothing she did was for herself

158
00:16:52,700 --> 00:16:56,300
Please deal with her leniently

159
00:16:56,700 --> 00:17:01,300
As immortals, we can't stay in Heaven
all the time to enjoy ourselves

160
00:17:01,700 --> 00:17:04,300
We should occasionally go on
an inspection tour...

161
00:17:04,700 --> 00:17:08,300
of the mortal world and do some
good deeds to help the common people

162
00:17:09,700 --> 00:17:12,300
If Ma-gu made any mistake,

163
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:16,300
it was that she didn't inform you
beforehand

164
00:17:17,700 --> 00:17:20,300
But she didn't bring
any disaster upon the people

165
00:17:20,700 --> 00:17:22,300
Please be perceptive

166
00:17:22,700 --> 00:17:25,300
Why do you keep speaking up
for her?

167
00:17:25,700 --> 00:17:28,300
Jade Emperor, we speak according
to our conscience

168
00:17:28,700 --> 00:17:35,300
Ma-gu, let me ask you.
Do you realize your mistake?

169
00:17:35,700 --> 00:17:39,300
Ever since the Three Stars descended
to the mortal world,

170
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:42,300
the people suffered
without their illumination

171
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:46,300
The Three Stars met with all kinds
of temptations in the mortal world

172
00:17:46,700 --> 00:17:50,300
I descended to the mortal world
to help them turn over a new leaf

173
00:17:50,700 --> 00:17:54,300
I acted with good intentions.
Please pardon me

174
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:58,300
Look how kind-hearted she is

175
00:17:58,700 --> 00:18:01,300
Is that so?
I disagree

176
00:18:01,700 --> 00:18:04,300
She shouldn't have fallen
in love with Mei Shouquan

177
00:18:06,700 --> 00:18:08,300
Jade Emperor!

178
00:18:08,700 --> 00:18:13,300
Please calm your anger.
The God of Plague framed her

179
00:18:13,700 --> 00:18:15,300
You're still trying to cover up
for her?

180
00:18:15,700 --> 00:18:21,300
I feel not all relationships between
a man and a woman are centred on love

181
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:26,300
Ma-gu had good intentions. She didn't
mean to oppose the Celestial Court

182
00:18:26,700 --> 00:18:29,300
You mean I'm being
unreasonable then?

183
00:18:32,700 --> 00:18:36,300
The Three Stars were presumptuous
and committed all kinds of outrages

184
00:18:36,700 --> 00:18:40,300
I banished them to the mortal world
so they would turn over a new leaf

185
00:18:40,700 --> 00:18:45,300
Not that I don't want the mortal world
to enjoy peace and prosperity,

186
00:18:45,700 --> 00:18:48,300
but there's a reason to everything

187
00:18:48,700 --> 00:18:51,300
I have to be fair in meting out
rewards and punishments

188
00:18:51,700 --> 00:18:53,300
I'd have dealt with anyone else
the same

189
00:18:54,300 --> 00:18:56,300
A country has its laws;
a family has its rules

190
00:18:56,700 --> 00:18:59,300
The Celestial Court, too,
has its heavenly laws

191
00:18:59,700 --> 00:19:03,300
Jade Emperor, you're right.
You're right

192
00:19:04,700 --> 00:19:08,300
Ma-gu, I know you acted with
good intentions

193
00:19:08,700 --> 00:19:14,300
But anyone who flouts the
heavenly laws has to be punished

194
00:19:14,700 --> 00:19:22,300
You have to go to the dungeon
and do some soul-searching

195
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:26,300
I promise you if the Three Stars
become the embodiment...

196
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:33,300
of long life and happiness
and benefit the people,

197
00:19:35,700 --> 00:19:42,300
I will allow them to return to the
Celestial Court and be reinstated

198
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:46,300
Deities, don't you think
that's fair?

199
00:19:46,700 --> 00:19:48,300
Jade Emperor, you are wise

200
00:19:51,700 --> 00:19:56,300
Ma-gu, from your frowns,

201
00:19:56,700 --> 00:20:01,300
I know you're still unconvinced

202
00:20:02,700 --> 00:20:06,300
Surely not? I feel after staying
in the mortal world,

203
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:10,300
her countenance has changed
somewhat

204
00:20:10,700 --> 00:20:13,300
Queen Mother, you're still
speaking up for her?

205
00:20:13,700 --> 00:20:19,300
Can't you tell gone is the
immortal aura that surrounded her?

206
00:20:19,700 --> 00:20:22,300
Taking its place is a vulgar look

207
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:27,300
She's troubled by affairs
of the mundane world

208
00:20:27,700 --> 00:20:31,300
Ma-gu, you really need
to do some soul-searching

209
00:20:33,700 --> 00:20:35,300
Court dismissed

210
00:20:56,700 --> 00:21:00,300
Sister Ma-gu, I've come to see you

211
00:21:03,700 --> 00:21:07,300
Sister, you've suffered

212
00:21:09,700 --> 00:21:12,300
It's my fault.
I got you into this

213
00:21:12,700 --> 00:21:17,300
Yet you still shielded me.
I'm so ashamed of myself

214
00:21:17,700 --> 00:21:22,300
Don't say that. I have no regrets
doing what I did

215
00:21:22,700 --> 00:21:25,300
You're still so stubborn?

216
00:21:25,700 --> 00:21:29,300
Only after descending to the mortal
world did I truly experience...

217
00:21:29,700 --> 00:21:31,300
the beauty of it

218
00:21:32,700 --> 00:21:35,300
I also found true love

219
00:21:35,700 --> 00:21:39,300
Perhaps this is what they mean
by the price of love

220
00:21:39,700 --> 00:21:42,300
I don't mind being imprisoned

221
00:21:42,700 --> 00:21:47,300
What depresses me is I'm unable to
love passionately as I did before

222
00:21:47,700 --> 00:21:53,300
Listen to that! This is no way
for an immortal to talk

223
00:21:53,700 --> 00:21:56,300
Well, you don't understand
what love is

224
00:21:58,700 --> 00:22:00,300
You're utterly befuddled

225
00:22:00,700 --> 00:22:03,300
Your years of cultivation
will go to waste soon

226
00:22:03,700 --> 00:22:05,300
When that happens,
you'll regret it

227
00:22:05,700 --> 00:22:10,300
I won't because Shou and I
truly love each other

228
00:22:10,700 --> 00:22:12,300
I hope you'll understand

229
00:22:12,700 --> 00:22:16,300
Of course I do.
Why wouldn't I understand?

230
00:22:16,700 --> 00:22:20,300
Years ago, when I descended to
the mortal world... Oh forget it

231
00:22:20,700 --> 00:22:26,300
I admire you,
your courage and perseverance

232
00:22:27,700 --> 00:22:31,300
Yes, I won't have any regrets

233
00:22:31,700 --> 00:22:36,300
As for me, my most important task
is to help The Three Stars...

234
00:22:36,700 --> 00:22:43,300
become the embodiment of
long life and happiness

235
00:22:43,700 --> 00:22:48,300
That will do them, the mortal world
and us good

236
00:22:49,700 --> 00:22:53,300
Ma-gu, do take care

237
00:23:14,700 --> 00:23:22,300
Ouyang Xiaotian, you cur,
I'm going to beat you to a pulp

238
00:23:42,700 --> 00:23:44,300
Well?

239
00:23:44,700 --> 00:23:47,300
A scholar who has been away for three
days must be looked at with new eyes

240
00:23:47,700 --> 00:23:53,300
My confidence in you is growing. You'll
be able to beat Ouyang Xiaotian soon

241
00:23:55,700 --> 00:23:57,300
The one behind

242
00:24:01,700 --> 00:24:05,300
There's something wrong with him.
It's as if he's mad

243
00:24:05,700 --> 00:24:08,300
Help him.
Quick!

244
00:24:09,700 --> 00:24:15,300
Erlang Diety, don't be so cruel.
Please let Ruyi go

245
00:24:15,700 --> 00:24:18,300
If you let her go, we needn't be
afraid of Ouyang Xiaotian

246
00:24:18,700 --> 00:24:22,300
Let Ruyi go and I promise you
I won't annoy you again

247
00:24:23,700 --> 00:24:26,300
Please let Ruyi go

248
00:24:26,700 --> 00:24:32,300
Shou, we should focus our energies
on dealing with Ouyang Xiaotian

249
00:24:32,700 --> 00:24:35,300
Don't let your mind wander

250
00:24:35,700 --> 00:24:38,300
I'm not letting my mind wander

251
00:24:41,700 --> 00:24:45,300
I saw Erlang Diety taking Ruyi away
with my own eyes

252
00:24:45,700 --> 00:24:48,300
I saw them flying to Heaven
on a cloud this big

253
00:24:48,700 --> 00:24:52,300
I'm not lying
but speaking the truth

254
00:24:52,700 --> 00:24:55,300
Shou, you've gone mad

255
00:24:56,700 --> 00:24:58,700
You weren't like this

256
00:24:58,700 --> 00:25:03,300
I'm not mad. Neither am I lying. After
being "brothers" for so many years,

257
00:25:03,700 --> 00:25:07,300
you all know I stutter
when I tell a lie

258
00:25:07,700 --> 00:25:11,300
I'm not stuttering now.
This proves I'm not lying

259
00:25:12,700 --> 00:25:16,300
I feel he's really...
he wasn't like this before

260
00:25:16,700 --> 00:25:19,300
The circumstances have
completely changed

261
00:25:19,700 --> 00:25:24,300
-He's lost all reason
-He's mad

262
00:25:24,700 --> 00:25:27,300
We can't let him
go on like this

263
00:25:30,700 --> 00:25:33,300
Cut it out!
You're driving me crazy!

264
00:25:33,700 --> 00:25:36,300
You must be shocked, eh?

265
00:25:36,700 --> 00:25:39,300
I'm what you call an immortal

266
00:25:39,700 --> 00:25:43,300
You two guys
are at a loss for words?

267
00:25:43,700 --> 00:25:45,300
Don't you get it?

268
00:25:46,700 --> 00:25:51,300
Despite possessing a big brain,
you're lacking in intelligence

269
00:25:51,700 --> 00:25:53,300
Shou, you should recognize me

270
00:25:53,700 --> 00:25:58,300
I appeared in your dream.
This is our second meeting

271
00:26:01,700 --> 00:26:06,300
How come you're having hiccups?
Why are you staring at me?

272
00:26:06,700 --> 00:26:08,300
It's a long story

273
00:26:08,700 --> 00:26:14,300
Ma-gu should be the one telling you this
but the Erlang Deity took her away

274
00:26:14,700 --> 00:26:17,300
That's how unpredictable life is

275
00:26:17,700 --> 00:26:20,300
So I'm telling you now

276
00:26:20,700 --> 00:26:26,300
Stop wasting your time. If you can't
become the embodiment of long life...

277
00:26:26,700 --> 00:26:29,300
and happiness before
your 30th birthday,

278
00:26:29,700 --> 00:26:33,300
you won't be able to return
to the Celestial Court

279
00:26:33,700 --> 00:26:38,300
When that happens, the world won't be
illuminated by you three stars anymore

280
00:26:38,700 --> 00:26:43,300
That's enough! Don't think we immortals
have nothing better to do...

281
00:26:43,700 --> 00:26:47,300
than chat with you guys -
I've got to go to work

282
00:26:52,700 --> 00:26:56,300
He appeared in my dream.
He's Zhang Guolao

283
00:26:57,700 --> 00:27:03,300
"Long life and happiness" is the test
the Jade Emperor set for us

284
00:27:16,300 --> 00:27:20,300
Fu Lu Shou had the guts
to challenge you?

285
00:27:20,700 --> 00:27:26,300
That's right. They seem to come
prepared. I'm worried

286
00:27:26,700 --> 00:27:30,300
That's why I came to ask you
to impart your skills to me

287
00:27:30,700 --> 00:27:36,300
Ma-gu's gone so they shouldn't be your
match. Why did they dare challenge you?

288
00:27:36,700 --> 00:27:41,300
I'm baffled too.
They seemed very confident

289
00:27:41,700 --> 00:27:44,300
But you have no confidence
in yourself

290
00:27:44,700 --> 00:27:48,300
No matter what,
I can't afford to lose

291
00:27:48,700 --> 00:27:52,300
So please impart all your skills
and powers to me

292
00:27:52,700 --> 00:27:56,300
As long as I win this battle,
I won't forget your kindness

293
00:27:56,700 --> 00:27:59,300
I know you're anxious to gain victory

294
00:27:59,700 --> 00:28:04,300
I will introduce to you
a more powerful teacher

295
00:28:17,700 --> 00:28:20,300
Where am I?

296
00:28:20,700 --> 00:28:23,300
Don't you desire to increase
your powers?

297
00:28:23,700 --> 00:28:27,300
Only it will be able
to grant you more powers

298
00:28:27,700 --> 00:28:30,700
Once its element
is injected into your body,

299
00:28:31,700 --> 00:28:34,300
the blood and qi of the two
of you will be one

300
00:28:34,700 --> 00:28:37,300
You will enjoy boundless power then

301
00:28:40,700 --> 00:28:42,300
Go in

302
00:29:15,700 --> 00:29:19,300
Jade Emperor!
Jade Emperor!

303
00:29:20,700 --> 00:29:24,300
What do you want me to do?

304
00:29:26,700 --> 00:29:30,300
When I was in Heaven, you banished
me to the mortal world...

305
00:29:30,700 --> 00:29:35,300
to become a human being
and a terrible man at that

306
00:29:37,700 --> 00:29:43,300
Heeding Ruyi's advice,
I gradually dropped all my bad habits

307
00:29:44,700 --> 00:29:49,300
Just when I was trying to turn over
a new leaf and save the people,

308
00:29:53,700 --> 00:29:58,300
you poured water on a drowning man
and took Ruyi away from me

309
00:30:00,700 --> 00:30:03,300
Just what do you want?

310
00:30:07,700 --> 00:30:09,300
Just what do you want?

311
00:30:11,700 --> 00:30:15,300
Have you gone senile?
Are you in a confused state of mind?

312
00:30:15,700 --> 00:30:18,300
Are you really
the Jade Emperor?

313
00:30:19,700 --> 00:30:23,300
Shou, you mustn't drink any more

314
00:30:23,700 --> 00:30:28,300
-Give me
-Your body won't be able to take it

315
00:30:30,700 --> 00:30:36,300
I'll fall out with whoever
dares to take away my drink

316
00:30:37,700 --> 00:30:41,300
Go ahead. A spineless man like you
is no friend of mine

317
00:30:41,700 --> 00:30:45,300
Our country is in chaos.
Yet you live a befuddled life

318
00:30:45,700 --> 00:30:47,300
Are you still a man?

319
00:30:47,700 --> 00:30:50,300
Help him! Help him!

320
00:30:53,700 --> 00:30:58,300
Fu is right. He's said exactly
what I wanted to tell you

321
00:30:58,700 --> 00:31:04,300
No matter where Miss Ma is, she
wouldn't want to see you in this state

322
00:31:04,700 --> 00:31:06,300
Don't let her down

323
00:31:13,700 --> 00:31:18,300
My greatest worry is Ma-gu

324
00:31:18,700 --> 00:31:22,300
I wonder what punishment
she'll suffer in Heaven

325
00:31:24,700 --> 00:31:27,300
I'm very anxious to see her

326
00:31:27,700 --> 00:31:30,300
We're just as anxious as you

327
00:31:30,700 --> 00:31:31,700
An important task awaits us

328
00:31:32,700 --> 00:31:36,300
We have to stop Ouyang Xiaotian from
bringing disaster upon the people

329
00:31:36,700 --> 00:31:42,300
Given your powers and with our help,
we can defeat Ouyang Xiaotian...

330
00:31:42,700 --> 00:31:46,300
and stop him from plunging
the people in an abyss of misery

331
00:31:46,700 --> 00:31:51,300
Get up! Let's pull together
to defeat Ouyang Xiaotian

332
00:31:51,700 --> 00:31:56,300
Then we can return to the Celestial
Court where you'll meet Miss Ma again

333
00:31:56,700 --> 00:32:02,300
You're right. When that happens,
we can illuminate the world again

334
00:32:32,700 --> 00:32:35,300
Are you really going to have
a showdown with Ouyang Xiaotian?

335
00:32:35,700 --> 00:32:38,300
I must keep my word

336
00:32:40,700 --> 00:32:48,300
Don't worry, Princess. Given the might
of the Three Stars, we'll be fine

337
00:32:48,700 --> 00:32:51,300
Why are you talking about
The Three Stars?

338
00:32:52,700 --> 00:32:57,300
When the three of us are together,
luck will surely smile on us

339
00:32:57,700 --> 00:33:00,300
I really admire your courage

340
00:33:00,700 --> 00:33:04,300
When I saw you entering Ping-an Town
alone yesterday,

341
00:33:04,700 --> 00:33:09,300
I felt I got to know a new you

342
00:33:09,700 --> 00:33:17,300
Don't say that. Your praise
will make me lose my way

343
00:33:17,700 --> 00:33:22,300
-I'm the one who lost my way
-What do you mean?

344
00:33:22,700 --> 00:33:25,300
The person I should have chosen
is you

345
00:33:25,700 --> 00:33:28,300
I've missed a good match

346
00:33:28,700 --> 00:33:32,300
I really regret turning you down

347
00:33:33,700 --> 00:33:36,300
How wilful of me
to believe Ouyang Xiaotian

348
00:33:40,700 --> 00:33:44,300
Princess, say no more

349
00:33:45,700 --> 00:33:48,300
Let bygones be bygones

350
00:33:51,700 --> 00:33:56,300
I don't know when
I'll be able to come back

351
00:34:12,700 --> 00:34:16,300
Shou's father, I've let you down

352
00:34:16,700 --> 00:34:22,300
I've failed to dissuade Shou from
having a showdown with Ouyang Xiaotian

353
00:34:22,700 --> 00:34:25,300
If anything untoward
happens to him,

354
00:34:26,700 --> 00:34:31,300
I will have let you down

355
00:34:35,700 --> 00:34:41,300
Shou, it wasn't easy for me
to bring you up

356
00:34:41,700 --> 00:34:45,300
Why wouldn't you listen to me?

357
00:34:46,700 --> 00:34:53,300
If you die, there'll be no more
meaning in life for me

358
00:34:53,700 --> 00:34:58,300
Can't you spare a thought for me?

359
00:34:58,700 --> 00:35:03,300
Shou, you've really broken
my heart

360
00:35:12,700 --> 00:35:15,300
I'm sorry, Mother

361
00:35:16,700 --> 00:35:18,300
I'm unfilial

362
00:35:24,700 --> 00:35:26,300
Showdown?

363
00:35:26,700 --> 00:35:33,300
You are a scholar not a general. Who
are you to have a showdown with him?

364
00:35:33,700 --> 00:35:39,300
The situation is pressing.
I can't worry so much

365
00:35:39,700 --> 00:35:42,300
Looks like it'll be dangerous

366
00:35:43,700 --> 00:35:46,300
Do you know how worried I am?

367
00:35:50,700 --> 00:35:53,300
Father, I'm a grown-up

368
00:35:54,700 --> 00:35:57,300
Stop worrying about me

369
00:35:57,700 --> 00:36:02,300
Child, when can I ever stop
worrying about you?

370
00:36:03,700 --> 00:36:08,300
At first, I was worried you wouldn't
be able to win honour and rank

371
00:36:08,700 --> 00:36:13,300
After you won honour and rank,
I was worried given your arrogance,

372
00:36:13,700 --> 00:36:16,300
you'd be ostracized

373
00:36:16,700 --> 00:36:19,300
Now that you enjoy high position
and great power,

374
00:36:19,700 --> 00:36:23,300
I'm worried others might plot
against you

375
00:36:23,700 --> 00:36:29,300
You tell me. When can my mind
ever be free from worries?

376
00:36:35,700 --> 00:36:37,300
I'm unfilial

377
00:36:37,700 --> 00:36:40,300
I keep making you worry about me

378
00:36:43,700 --> 00:36:46,300
By becoming the top scholar
in the imperial exams,

379
00:36:46,700 --> 00:36:49,300
I've fulfilled your wish...

380
00:36:49,700 --> 00:36:52,300
and brought honour
to our ancestors

381
00:36:53,700 --> 00:36:57,300
Father... I beg you

382
00:36:58,700 --> 00:37:00,300
I beg you

383
00:37:01,700 --> 00:37:06,300
Do not worry about me anymore

384
00:37:06,700 --> 00:37:09,300
If winning top honours
in the imperial exam means...

385
00:37:09,700 --> 00:37:13,300
I'll lose my son - I'd rather
you not be the Number One scholar

386
00:37:42,700 --> 00:37:46,300
You are a grown-up. I don't want
to breathe down your neck

387
00:37:49,700 --> 00:37:54,300
Go and do what you have to do

388
00:37:54,700 --> 00:38:01,300
But when you're done,
don't forget to come home

389
00:38:05,700 --> 00:38:07,300
I...

390
00:38:09,700 --> 00:38:12,300
I won't be able to make it back

391
00:38:12,700 --> 00:38:17,300
Touch wood! What a thing to say
when you haven't even fought the battle!

392
00:38:17,700 --> 00:38:19,300
I don't want to hear that

393
00:38:19,700 --> 00:38:22,300
I don't mean that

394
00:38:22,700 --> 00:38:26,300
After my battle
with Ouyang Xiaotian tomorrow,

395
00:38:28,700 --> 00:38:31,300
I'll be training
to become an immortal

396
00:38:31,700 --> 00:38:36,300
Become an immortal?
What immortal?

397
00:38:36,700 --> 00:38:38,300
Have you gone mad?

398
00:38:41,700 --> 00:38:44,300
Fu, Shou and I...

399
00:38:47,700 --> 00:38:50,300
are the Three Stars - Fu Lu Shou

400
00:38:50,700 --> 00:38:55,300
We were banished to the mortal world
because we flouted heavenly laws

401
00:38:55,700 --> 00:38:59,300
Before we turn 30, we have to
accumulate enough credit...

402
00:38:59,700 --> 00:39:02,300
to be reinstated as immortals

403
00:39:02,700 --> 00:39:05,300
Lu, I'm befuddled

404
00:39:05,700 --> 00:39:10,300
What's this about fighting it out with
Ouyang Xiaotian and becoming an immortal?

405
00:39:10,700 --> 00:39:13,300
Father, pardon me
for being unfilial

406
00:39:14,700 --> 00:39:19,300
Stop it. I don't want you to
become an immortal. Just come home

407
00:39:20,700 --> 00:39:22,300
Take care

408
00:39:23,700 --> 00:39:25,300
Lu!

409
00:39:29,700 --> 00:39:31,300
Farewell, Father

410
00:39:33,700 --> 00:39:36,300
Lu! Lu!

411
00:39:36,700 --> 00:39:40,300
I don't want you to become an immortal.
I want you to come home

412
00:39:40,700 --> 00:39:43,300
I'll be waiting for you

413
00:39:43,700 --> 00:39:46,300
I'll be waiting for you

414
00:40:08,700 --> 00:40:10,300
Brother Fuqi

415
00:40:12,700 --> 00:40:16,300
What's wrong?
You look under the weather

416
00:40:18,700 --> 00:40:22,300
It's so late. Did you come
to see me about something urgent?

417
00:40:24,700 --> 00:40:28,300
Shuangxi, I'm leaving

418
00:40:30,700 --> 00:40:33,300
I came to bid you farewell

419
00:40:33,700 --> 00:40:37,300
-You're going to fight Ouyang Xiaotian?
-How did you know?

420
00:40:38,700 --> 00:40:44,300
You've been looking very troubled
so I guessed that's the reason

421
00:40:44,700 --> 00:40:48,300
Ouyang Xiaotian is a scourge

422
00:40:48,700 --> 00:40:53,300
Unless we get rid of him,
the people will suffer

423
00:40:53,700 --> 00:40:58,300
Shuangxi, do I have your support?

424
00:41:07,700 --> 00:41:10,300
I'm just an ordinary girl

425
00:41:11,700 --> 00:41:14,300
I don't want you to risk your life

426
00:41:15,700 --> 00:41:19,300
But I know if I stop you
from going,

427
00:41:19,700 --> 00:41:22,300
you'll regret it for life...

428
00:41:24,700 --> 00:41:26,300
so I'll give you my support

429
00:41:30,700 --> 00:41:32,300
Thanks, Shuangxi

430
00:41:34,700 --> 00:41:37,300
I'll wait for you to come back

431
00:41:37,700 --> 00:41:39,300
I will go on waiting

432
00:41:44,700 --> 00:41:47,300
Shuangxi, listen to me

433
00:41:49,700 --> 00:41:51,300
If I don't make it back,

434
00:41:53,700 --> 00:41:55,300
marry another man

435
00:41:55,700 --> 00:42:00,300
No, I told you I will marry you
and no other

436
00:42:00,700 --> 00:42:02,300
Listen to me

437
00:42:02,700 --> 00:42:06,300
What are you going to say?
I'm not good enough for you?

438
00:42:07,700 --> 00:42:09,300
Or are you afraid of my sis?

439
00:42:09,700 --> 00:42:12,300
-No
-Why?

440
00:42:12,700 --> 00:42:16,300
-Listen to me
-I don't want to! I don't want to!

441
00:42:18,700 --> 00:42:22,300
Whether I manage to get rid
of Ouyang Xiaotian or not,

442
00:42:23,700 --> 00:42:25,300
whether I'll be successful or not,

443
00:42:27,700 --> 00:42:30,300
I won't be able to make it back

444
00:42:30,700 --> 00:42:33,300
I don't want you to wait
in vain for me

445
00:42:33,700 --> 00:42:39,300
If you win the battle,
why can't you make it back?

446
00:42:39,700 --> 00:42:41,300
I'll wait for you

447
00:42:47,700 --> 00:42:52,300
Shuangxi, I don't want to deceive you.
I just found out myself

448
00:42:53,700 --> 00:42:56,300
I'm actually Fu (Fortune) of
The Three Stars

449
00:42:56,700 --> 00:43:00,300
I was banished to the mortal world
and became a man

450
00:43:00,700 --> 00:43:06,300
I must accumulate credit before
I can return to the Celestial Court

451
00:43:06,700 --> 00:43:08,300
Do you get it?

452
00:43:12,700 --> 00:43:17,300
I don't believe you...
I don't believe you

453
00:43:17,700 --> 00:43:21,300
Believe me.
I hate to leave you

454
00:43:21,700 --> 00:43:26,300
-You're lying to me...
-I'm not! I'm not!

455
00:43:26,700 --> 00:43:30,300
I thought there was a thief.
Someone has become an immortal, eh?

456
00:43:30,700 --> 00:43:35,300
Wu Fuqi, weren't you a gambler?
When did you become an immortal?

457
00:43:35,700 --> 00:43:41,300
-I'm really the Fortune Star
-And I'm the Queen Mother

458
00:43:41,700 --> 00:43:48,300
You think Shuangxi's not good enough for
you after her "marriage" to Shi Yaoqian?

459
00:43:48,700 --> 00:43:53,300
How nice you make it sound.
Shuangxi did that to save you

460
00:43:53,700 --> 00:43:57,300
What are you talking about?
Am I that sort?

461
00:43:57,700 --> 00:44:03,300
What are you staying for? He's lying.
You really think he's an immortal?

462
00:44:04,700 --> 00:44:08,300
What are you still standing here for?
Go home

463
00:44:09,700 --> 00:44:11,300
Shuangxi!

464
00:44:11,700 --> 00:44:14,300
Come on! Come on!

465
00:44:22,700 --> 00:44:24,300
Shuangxi!

466
00:44:24,700 --> 00:44:26,700
Subtitled by Transtar Media Services


